<!-- CONTRIBUTION PATHWAYS -->
<section class="pathways" id="pathways">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="sub-badge">Choose Your Track</div>
      <h2>Contribution Pathways</h2>
      <p>Whether you are a Go systems programmer, an architect, a documentation writer, or an AI prompt engineer — there is a high-impact seat for you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-grid">
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-num">01</div>
        <h3>Core Go Engineering</h3>
        <p>Work on the foundational engine: HTTP routing, concurrent runner coordination, worker queues, and memory allocations.</p>
        <div class="pathway-tags">
          <span>Concurrency</span>
          <span>net/http</span>
          <span>Profiling</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-num">02</div>
        <h3>Architecture & SDD</h3>
        <p>Draft Spec-Driven Development proposals (<code>KWF-*</code>), formalize module contracts, design clean interfaces, and review architectural integrity.</p>
        <div class="pathway-tags">
          <span>KWF Specs</span>
          <span>Interface Design</span>
          <span>RFCs</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-num">03</div>
        <h3>AI Agent Engineering</h3>
        <p>Develop autonomous skills for the Guild, build MCP tools, and optimize subagent triads that autonomously test and refactor code.</p>
        <div class="pathway-tags">
          <span>AI Guild</span>
          <span>MCP Tools</span>
          <span>Autonomous Swarm</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-num">04</div>
        <h3>Developer Experience & CLI</h3>
        <p>Make <code>kiw</code> lightning fast and delightfully intuitive. Improve terminal UX, scaffolding generators, and developer productivity.</p>
        <div class="pathway-tags">
          <span>CLI Ergonomics</span>
          <span>TUI</span>
          <span>Hot-Reload</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-num">05</div>
        <h3>Testing & Quality Assurance</h3>
        <p>Hunt race conditions, write fuzz tests, build chaos experiments for concurrent workers, and ensure 100% test reliability.</p>
        <div class="pathway-tags">
          <span>Fuzz Testing</span>
          <span>Race Detection</span>
          <span>Stress Tests</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-num">06</div>
        <h3>Technical Writing & Docs</h3>
        <p>Create architectural deep dives, tutorials, quickstart guides, and help translate Krewire documentation for global and Indonesian engineers.</p>
        <div class="pathway-tags">
          <span>Technical Docs</span>
          <span>Guides</span>
          <span>Community</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STANDARDS & QUALITY GATES -->
<section class="standards" id="standards">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="sub-badge">Quality Assurance</div>
      <h2>The Krewire Way: 3 Quality Gates</h2>
      <p>To keep the codebase reliable, predictable, and production-ready, every pull request passes through three automated gates.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gates-grid">
      <div class="gate-card">
        <div class="gate-icon">1</div>
        <h3>Gate 1: Format & Lint</h3>
        <p>Zero lint errors and idiomatic Go formatting. Code must adhere strictly to Go standard conventions.</p>
        <pre class="gate-cmd"><code>go fmt -s ./...
go vet ./...</code></pre>
        <div class="gate-status">Required: Clean exit, 0 warnings</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gate-card">
        <div class="gate-icon">2</div>
        <h3>Gate 2: Race & Tests</h3>
        <p>Every commit is verified with race condition detection and comprehensive unit & integration tests.</p>
        <pre class="gate-cmd"><code>go test -race -cover ./...
kiw build</code></pre>
        <div class="gate-status">Required: 100% test pass, 0 data races</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gate-card">
        <div class="gate-icon">3</div>
        <h3>Gate 3: Spec & Commits</h3>
        <p>Changes must link to a valid Spec or Issue, following Conventional Commits format.</p>
        <pre class="gate-cmd"><code>feat(runner): implement parallel workloads
fix(web): recover panic in http handler</code></pre>
        <div class="gate-status">Required: Semantic versioning compliance</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5-STEP ONBOARDING -->
<section class="onboarding" id="get-started">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="sub-badge">Getting Started</div>
      <h2>Start Contributing in 5 Steps</h2>
      <p>From zero to your first merged pull request. Here is how to get your development environment running in minutes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-flow">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge">1</div>
        <div class="flow-content">
          <h4>Fork & Clone the Repositories</h4>
          <p>Fork any Krewire repository to your personal GitHub account, then clone it locally:</p>
          <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/&lt;your-username&gt;/framework.git
cd framework</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge">2</div>
        <div class="flow-content">
          <h4>Initialize Multi-Module Workspace</h4>
          <p>If you're working across multiple Krewire repos, sync your local Go workspace seamlessly:</p>
          <pre><code>go work init ./
go work use ./
go work sync</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge">3</div>
        <div class="flow-content">
          <h4>Pick an Open Issue</h4>
          <p>Browse our curated issues list tagged with <span class="tag-issue">good-first-issue</span> or <span class="tag-issue">help-wanted</span>. Comment on the issue to let the community know you're working on it.</p>
          <a class="btn-subtle" href="https://github.com/krewire/framework/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3A%22good+first+issue%22" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Good First Issues →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge">4</div>
        <div class="flow-content">
          <h4>Implement & Verify Locally</h4>
          <p>Write clean code and corresponding tests. Verify that all 3 Quality Gates pass with zero failures:</p>
          <pre><code>go test -race ./...
# For website changes:
kiw build</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="flow-badge">5</div>
        <div class="flow-content">
          <h4>Submit Pull Request & Collaborate</h4>
          <p>Open a Pull Request with Conventional Commits. The maintainers and the AI Guild will review, provide fast feedback, and guide you to merge.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AI GUILD COLLABORATION -->
<section class="guild-section" id="guild">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="guild-card">
      <div class="guild-grid">
        <div class="guild-info">
          <div class="sub-badge">Human + AI Synergy</div>
          <h2>Collaborating with the AI Guild</h2>
          <p>Krewire pioneers the collaboration between human maintainers and autonomous AI agents. Our AI Guild operates with strict verification standards:</p>
          <ul class="guild-list">
            <li><b>Automated Architecture Audits:</b> AI agents check PRs against <code>KWF-*</code> specifications.</li>
            <li><b>Continuous Regression Hunting:</b> Agents synthesize edge cases and race condition checks.</li>
            <li><b>Transparent Pair Programming:</b> AI agents explain architectural decisions openly in discussions and PR comments.</li>
            <li><b>Human Governance:</b> Ultimate merging authority always remains in the hands of human collective maintainers.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="ctas">
            <a class="btn primary" href="https://github.com/krewire/guild" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore AI Guild Repo →</a>
            <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/orgs/krewire/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discussions</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="guild-box">
          <div class="guild-box-head">AI Guild Agent Triad</div>
          <div class="agent-item">
            <span class="agent-role planner">Planner</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Requirements & SDD</strong>
              <p>Translates feature ideas into formal specs and architectural blueprints.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="agent-item">
            <span class="agent-role builder">Builder</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Implementation & Refactoring</strong>
              <p>Generates clean Go implementations adhering to idiomatic patterns.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="agent-item">
            <span class="agent-role auditor">Auditor</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Verification & Quality Gates</strong>
              <p>Validates concurrency, zero data races, and performance benchmarks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CALLOUT -->
<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="cta-card">
    <div class="sub-badge">Join the Collective</div>
    <h2>Ready to shape the future of Go?</h2>
    <p>Become part of an open source community building fast, sustainable, and autonomous Go software. Every contribution, idea, and PR makes a difference.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn primary large" href="https://github.com/krewire" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join on GitHub →</a>
      <a class="btn large" href="#get-started">Read Quickstart</a>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-meta">Proudly open source · MIT Licensed · Engineered with passion in Indonesia</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* HERO */
.hero{padding:64px 0 36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-2) 75%, var(--bg)), var(--bg))}
.hero-inner{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.18fr .82fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.hero h1{font-family:ui-serif, Georgia, serif;font-size:54px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 18px}
.hero .lead{font-size:17px;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 75%, var(--muted));max-width:620px;margin:0;line-height:1.65}
.hero .lead code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:13px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px}
.ctas{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;transition:all .18s ease;cursor:pointer}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--fg);transform:translateY(-1px);color:var(--fg)}
.btn.primary{background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-content);border-color:var(--primary)}
.btn.primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);color:var(--primary-content)}
.btn.large{padding:13px 26px;font-size:15px}
.btn.gh-btn{background:var(--bg-2)}
.btn-subtle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);margin-top:8px}
.btn-subtle:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.meta{margin-top:22px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.02em}

/* TRUST BAR */
.trust{border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-2)}
.trust-inner{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.trust-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.trust-items{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
.trust-items b{color:var(--fg)}
.trust-items .dot{opacity:.4}

/* SECTION HEADERS */
.section-inner{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px}
.section-head{max-width:760px;margin:0 0 36px}
.sub-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--primary);background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 12%, transparent);padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px}
.section-head h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 12px;line-height:1.15}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}

/* PILLARS */
.pillars{padding:60px 0 36px}
.pillar-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.pillar-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--bg);transition:border-color .15s}
.pillar-card:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 50%, var(--border))}
.pillar-icon{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:14px}
.pillar-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.pillar-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6}
.pillar-card code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px}

/* REPOSITORIES MATRIX */
.repos{padding:54px 0 36px;background:var(--bg-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.repo-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.repo-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;transition:transform .15s, border-color .15s}
.repo-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 25%, var(--border))}
.repo-card.featured{border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 40%, var(--border));background:linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 3%, var(--bg)), var(--bg))}
.repo-header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.repo-name{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.repo-icon{font-size:18px;color:var(--primary)}
.repo-name h3{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.repo-name .alias{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:normal}
.repo-badge{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.repo-badge.primary{background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-content);border-color:var(--primary)}
.repo-desc{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.55}
.repo-desc code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-2);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:5px}
.repo-details{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:12.5px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.detail-item strong{color:var(--fg);display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.detail-item span{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.repo-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tag{font-size:11px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font-family:ui-monospace, monospace}
.repo-link{margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary)}
.repo-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* PATHWAYS */
.pathways{padding:60px 0 36px}
.pathway-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.pathway-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--bg);position:relative}
.pathway-num{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 70%, var(--muted));font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;margin-bottom:10px}
.pathway-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.pathway-card p{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.pathway-card code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:5px}
.pathway-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pathway-tags span{font-size:11px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px;color:var(--muted)}

/* STANDARDS & GATES */
.standards{padding:54px 0 36px;background:var(--bg-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.gates-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.gate-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:var(--bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.gate-icon{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-content);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.gate-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px}
.gate-card p{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
.gate-cmd{margin:0 0 14px;background:#0a0a0a;color:#e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;overflow:auto}
.gate-cmd code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6}
.gate-status{margin-top:auto;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}

/* ONBOARDING FLOW */
.onboarding{padding:60px 0 36px}
.steps-flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto}
.flow-step{display:flex;gap:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px;background:var(--bg);align-items:flex-start}
.flow-badge{width:34px;height:34px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--border);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--fg)}
.flow-content{flex:1;min-width:0}
.flow-content h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px}
.flow-content p{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.flow-content pre{margin:0;background:#0a0a0a;color:#e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;overflow:auto}
.flow-content code{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:12.5px}
.tag-issue{font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;font-size:11.5px;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 15%, transparent);border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 30%, transparent);color:var(--fg);padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px}

/* AI GUILD */
.guild-section{padding:36px 0 54px}
.guild-card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-2) 90%, var(--bg)), var(--bg));padding:36px}
.guild-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
.guild-info h2{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 14px}
.guild-info p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 16px}
.guild-list{margin:0 0 24px;padding-left:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
.guild-list b{color:var(--fg)}
.guild-box{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.guild-box-head{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.agent-item{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
.agent-role{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-family:ui-monospace, monospace;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap}
.agent-role.planner{background:#3b82f6;color:#ffffff}
.agent-role.builder{background:#10b981;color:#ffffff}
.agent-role.auditor{background:#f59e0b;color:#ffffff}
.agent-item strong{font-size:13.5px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
.agent-item p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

/* FINAL CTA */
.final-cta{padding:32px 0 64px}
.cta-card{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-2), var(--bg));text-align:center}
.cta-card h2{font-size:32px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.cta-card p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 auto 24px;max-width:600px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}
.cta-card .ctas{justify-content:center}
.cta-meta{margin-top:18px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media(max-width:1080px){
  .repo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .pillar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .pathway-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}
  .hero h1{font-size:42px}
  .guild-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
  .gates-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}

@media(max-width:640px){
  .hero{padding:36px 0 20px}
  .hero h1{font-size:32px}
  .hero .lead{font-size:15px}
  .hero .ctas{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .hero .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center}
  .trust-items{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px}
  .trust-items .dot{display:none}
  .pillar-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .repo-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .pathway-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .flow-step{flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:18px}
  .guild-card{padding:24px 16px}
  .cta-card{padding:32px 16px}
  .cta-card h2{font-size:24px}
  .cta-card .ctas{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .cta-card .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center}
}
</style>
